msgid "TITLE-PAGE"
msgstr ""
"# Notebook Generator\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"## Description\n"
"This notebook was generated with **Notebook Generator**, a desktop tool developed in Python that allows you to create and customize notebooks quickly and consistently from a predefined configuration.\n"
"\n"
"The goal is to simplify the creation of notebooks with:\n"
"- Standard structure (sections, titles, templates).\n"
"- Customizable configuration (theme, language, font size).\n"
"- Integration with data analysis or technical documentation workflows.\n"
"\n"
"---"

msgid "IMPORTANT-INFO-BREFORE-RUNING"
msgstr "> It is important to keep in mind that this automatically generated notebook is not intended to replace a data analyst, since the processed information still needs to be analyzed and reviewed by a specialist. It is recommended to review both the code and the results before using them for decision-making."

